Constraints.Constraint:
Phase 9 does not invent precision on anchors. exportConfidence on language analysis stays
where it is. §9.4's precision column is documented as the intended gate-consumable axis;
it is not delivered as an anchor attribute in this change.

AcceptanceCriteria.AC-EPOCH-IDENTITY-OPTIONAL:
Proposal P1 / A55.4. kind=opened may carry optional harness-stated executor identity;
when absent, report and joins degrade with a reason. Discriminating negatives: missing
identity does not fail lint on existing trees; openEpoch without identity still works;
identity is not inventable by ngrace from argv defaults that pretend to be the model.
